# Project Analysis Report

## 1. Project Overview

This project focuses on using **Python and Pandas for data analysis and statistical operations**. The project demonstrates how structured data can be loaded, explored, manipulated, and analysed using Python.

The main focus is on understanding data through Pandas rather than performing calculations manually. It gives practical experience with working with DataFrames, selecting data, filtering records, performing statistical calculations, and organizing information for analysis.

Overall, the project represents a practical step from learning basic Python programming toward working with real-world data.

