## 5. Key Pandas Concepts Demonstrated

The project provides practical exposure to several important Pandas concepts.

### DataFrame

The DataFrame is the primary structure used for handling tabular data.

### Data Selection

Rows and columns can be selected according to the requirements of the analysis.

### Conditional Filtering

Conditions can be applied to identify records that satisfy particular requirements.

### Descriptive Statistics

Functions such as `mean()`, `median()`, `min()`, `max()` and `describe()` help summarize numerical information.

### GroupBy

`groupby()` makes it possible to divide data into categories and perform calculations on individual groups.

### Data Inspection

Functions such as `info()` and `describe()` help understand the dataset before deeper analysis is performed.

